$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~12 min | Difficulty: Hard]] A freighter drifts dead on the edge of the Ravine, her beacon calling for rescue. The Raptor Lifeline goes in to take off her crew and Red flight goes with her. Command doesn't like how quiet the sector is.", -1)
$end_multi_text

